Package: linux-redmi-marble
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, kmod, linux-base
Recommends: firmware-redmi-marble
Description: Linux kernel for Xiaomi Redmi Note 12 Turbo (marble)
 Mainline Linux 7.2.8 kernel with the marble (Poco F5 / Redmi Note 12 Turbo,
 SM7475) device enablement patches from the iLtanaka linux-marble tree.
 .
 Built with LLVM/ThinLTO and ccache. Ships the uncompressed kernel Image
 (as vmlinuz-<ver>), the device tree, and the out-of-tree modules. No
 initramfs is generated (no-initramfs direct boot, the path verified by the
 original port); the postinst syncs vmlinuz + DTB to the ESP and rewrites
 /extlinux/extlinux.conf when /boot/efi is mounted.
 .
 Local deviations from the author's reference config: CONFIG_LTO_CLANG_THIN=y
 and CONFIG_NTSYNC=m.
